*cupsCommands: "ReportLevels"
*cupsLanguages: "en"

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/Black and White: "<</cupsColorSpace 18/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*DefaultResolution: 600dpi

*OpenUI *PrintQuality/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PrintQuality
*DefaultPrintQuality: Standard
*PrintQuality High/Super Fine (plain paper): "<</HWResolution[600 600]/OutputType(High)>>setpagedevice"
*PrintQuality Standard/Standard (600 dpi): "<</HWResolution[600 600]/OutputType(Standard)>>setpagedevice"
*PrintQuality Draft/Draft (300 dpi): "<</HWResolution[300 300]/OutputType(Draft)>>setpagedevice"
*PrintQuality Fast/Fast (300 dpi, quickest): "<</HWResolution[300 300]/OutputType(Fast)>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PrintQuality

*OpenUI *MediaType/Paper Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Plain
*MediaType Plain/Plain Paper: "<</MediaType(Plain)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType PhotoPro/Photo Paper Pro: "<</MediaType(PhotoPro)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType PhotoPlusGlossyII/Photo Paper Plus Glossy II: "<</MediaType(PhotoPlusGlossyII)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType PhotoPlusGlossy/Photo Paper Plus Glossy: "<</MediaType(PhotoPlusGlossy)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType PhotoPlusSemiGloss/Photo Paper Plus Semi-gloss: "<</MediaType(PhotoPlusSemiGloss)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType GlossyPhoto/Glossy Photo Paper: "<</MediaType(GlossyPhoto)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Matte/Matte Photo Paper: "<</MediaType(Matte)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType HighRes/High Resolution Paper: "<</MediaType(HighRes)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Envelope/Envelope: "<</MediaType(Envelope)>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*OpenUI *InkDensity/Ink Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *InkDensity
*DefaultInkDensity: 95
*InkDensity 100/Full (100%): ""
*InkDensity 95/Normal (95%, like Canon): ""
*InkDensity 85/Light (85%): ""
*InkDensity 75/Draft (75%): ""
*CloseUI: *InkDensity

